{"id":"NCT04033224","title":"Use of EBPT in Critically Ill Patients With AKI and/or Multiorgan Failure","official":"Use of EBPT in Critically Ill Patients With AKI and/or Multiorgan Failure: a Multicenter Prospective Observational Registry","summary":"The use of extracorporeal blood purification therapies (EBPT) is becoming increasingly widespread worldwide in everyday clinical practice, particularly in the critical care setting. Nonetheless, most of the clinical trials aimed at exploring the effect of EBPT on patients' long-term outcomes have failed to demonstrate consistent results regarding 28 day- or hospital- mortality rates. The aim of this observational prospective registry is to evaluate if there is a cluster of critically ill patients that mostly benefits from extracorporeal blood purification therapies with different EBPTs.","conditions":["Critical Illness","Acute Kidney Injury","Sepsis","Systemic Inflammatory Response Syndrome"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"Commercial membrane for Extracorporeal Blood Purification Therapy (EBPT)"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* critically ill patients in the ICU\n* one of this EPB therapy:\n* CRRT/IHD/Hybrid therapies for support//replacement renal function\n* immunomodulation achieved by \"high cut-off membranes\", \"endotoxins and/or cytokines adsorbent membranes\" or by high-volume hemofiltration\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* patients treated only by Cytosorb® and/or Toraymyxin® therapies","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":1000,"start":"2019-07-16","pcd":"2025-09-30","upd":"2025-02-12","sponsor":"Careggi Hospital","areas":["other"],"central":["Gianluca Villa, MD · +393207615547 · gianluca.villa@unifi.it"],"sites":[{"f":"Ospedale S. Giuseppe","city":"Empoli","pr":"","zip":"50053","s":"R","lat":43.718,"lon":10.9476,"c":"Italo Calamai, MD · +383892840820 · italo.calamai72@gmail.com"},{"f":"Ospedale Versilia","city":"Lido di Camaiore"